abstract: >-
  Working research archive for an automated honey-bee sleep-like immobility
  experiment. The repository contains Jetson acquisition code, original logs,
  structurally cleaned datasets, record-level audits, comparison figures,
  reports, and reproducibility checks. It remains private and under scientific
  and release review.
